# Peticiones de prueba para Visual Studio / VS Code (REST Client).
# 1) Ejecute "login" y copie accessToken en @token.
@host = http://localhost:5000
@token = PEGAR_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Login del cajero de demostración
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "cajero", "password": "Cajero123!" }

### Productos del POS
GET {{host}}/api/products?search=norte
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sesión POS activa
GET {{host}}/api/pos/sessions/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sesiones abiertas
GET {{host}}/api/pos/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Venta con 2 productos y efectivo (reenviar con el mismo clientOperationId debe devolver replay=true)
POST {{host}}/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientOperationId": "7b0f1a52-4a1e-4f7e-9d7b-0c2f6f9e1a01",
  "sessionId": 1,
  "lines": [
    { "productId": 3, "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": 4, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Historial
GET {{host}}/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalle (cambie el id)
GET {{host}}/api/sales/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
